{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "964e28d0-6792-5976-9b5e-33acc904def3", "source_ordinal": 1464, "reading_ordinal": 2593, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "该死的张三", "published_at": "2024-07-15T21:56:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/343038619/answer/3562980201"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "长效避孕措施很多的，没必要用这么麻烦的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "实在达不成一致，只能相忘于江湖呀。", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "其实这类问题问的角度都有问题，私人决定，你根本就不能问任何人“怎么办”。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "人家出“怎么”，你来“办”，谈一场恋爱，兄弟们负责出脑，你负责出xx，爽不死你是吧？", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你可以问“除了结扎，还有什么副作用小且可逆的长效避孕措施”，这是个学术问题，和具体人无关；你也可以问“遇到生育观不一致有哪些应对方法”，这仍然是一个学术问题，和具体人无关。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你问“我的女朋友如何如何如何，我要怎么办”，那麻烦你放开那个女仔，让出点子的兄弟来吧。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "连民间故事都知道谁上擂台谁进洞房，你倒好，虚竹破棋局，段誉入洞房？", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "说得过去吗？帮你当枪手的人本质上和帮你按住对方的家伙有什么区别？", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "人家要因为你自己的智慧和勇气来爱你，不能因为你兄弟的智慧和勇气来爱你——真要是这样，你有脸硬得起来吗？", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 370}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "光你这问法，只要对方知道了，你就没活路了。人家女生未必清楚是为什么，但单凭直觉就知道你这行为极端可恶。", "char_start": 371, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "各种青春爱情剧里最可耻、最卑劣的行为是什么？就是张三帮李四写情书追女神，女神感动得潸然泪下，跟李四滚到了一起。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "册那，我tm何止不觉得张三“伟大”“智慧”，我只觉得张三该死。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你们仔细想想，张三是不是该死？", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你跟扮流氓配合某个蠢材演“英雄救美”的人有什么区别？你是不是还觉得这很“有义气”、很“伟大”？", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人家的一条命，人家的终身幸福，就是你拿来讨好你兄弟的消耗品，是吗？", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 608}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你大声回答看看？", "char_start": 609, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你要是再跟我说这个女生还是你的暗恋对象，你是在帮你的“兄弟”写情书，帮演“英雄救美”，你还觉得挺自豪，女主还居然觉得“很感动”……", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我这么说吧，这要是我女儿，我拼了这条命不要，也要把你灭了！", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 713}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "反正我教育这么失败，这是我罪有应得。", "char_start": 714, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要问人“怎么办”，问那些能帮助你决定怎么办的其它问题，客观的、与具体人无关的科学问题、伦理问题。", "char_start": 734, "char_end": 783}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 21}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女朋友为了不要小孩天天要我结扎，怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“该死的张三”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“长效避孕措施很多的，没必要用这么麻烦的做法。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "长效避孕措施很多的，没必要用这么麻烦的做法。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 22, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ab6c4aca-a120-5478-ab36-af87f9578b03", "source_ordinal": 1463, "reading_ordinal": 2594, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无私怨", "published_at": "2024-07-16T13:32:33+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661457792/answer/3563582071"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这不是很正常吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "老实说，我还挺欣慰的——这不是正说明大V在中国也得按一般规则办事吗？", "char_start": 9, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "难道我们想要一个“只要够出名，就一切规则都拦不住”的社会？", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 73}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "爱国、出名，但一旦被基本法规限制就仍然没有例外，这不是健康社会本来就应该有的样子吗？", "char_start": 74, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "反倒是一爱国、一出名，就会被网开一面、被特事特办，这才会扭曲人本来高尚的动机，搞成“没有是非，只有利益”。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "作为一个观众，其实我很喜欢看到大V们有家常的苦恼，这是好事。因为这说明这个人确实还是大众的一员，而不是一个半仙，一个其实和大众疾苦脱离的人。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta要寻求渠道、关系的帮助，如果是私下里寻求，那是另一回事；如果是公开寻求，怎么可能找到什么违规、非法的手段？", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "即使是来自内部工作人员的帮助，也只可能限于告诉他一些他可能自己没找到的针对特殊人群的特别优惠政策，指导他去申请，还能怎么样？", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果他也真的在这个帮助下达成了目的，那不正好对这些大V都不了解的政策做一个活广告？", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这到底有啥神奇的“不行”“可耻”？", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这个就跟有人在黑社会混久了，发现某个企业主遇到事情没有现场打回去而是报警，于是嘲笑对方“没有实力”一样，本身就是基于一个错位在先的价值观才会有的嘲笑。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "万民平等，本来就是我们的理想，真看到它实现了，能难住大V——尤其是以爱国为要点的大V——了，这是个好事。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "爱不是拿来索要特权的筹码，也不该是。", "char_start": 551, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "不要理会一些人“你这么爱ta，ta却对你没有一点优待”的嘲笑。因为恰恰是因为我不会因此索要特别优待，我才万分确信爱的实在。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "否则我跟行贿的、勒索的，有何本质的分别？只是支付币种、武术招式不同吗？", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我爱你，这是公事，公事公办，这是我应该有的困难。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你不必纠结。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 699}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价卢克文朋友圈发文求助解决孩子在成都市上学以及户口迁移问题?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“无私怨”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这不是很正常吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这不是很正常吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 8, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "16042688-91a3-58c1-a4dc-a2221bc6b9ee", "source_ordinal": 1462, "reading_ordinal": 2595, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不配的天神", "published_at": "2024-07-16T15:31:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660929832/answer/3563707846"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你觉得自己不够好、不配，这个其实不是你的课题，而是对方的课题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为人去爱一个人，是很忌讳自己觉得自己很配、很够好的。觉得自己很好、很配，就会很容易对对方有种种挑剔、勉强，不由自主地想要改造对方、“提升对方”。这种想法最后几乎肯定会演变成对对方人格的不尊重——如果这本身还不算是一种不尊重的话。", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因此，一个比较健康、有生命力的爱的关系，常常是伴随有“各自都觉得自己非常幸运，不断地向对方倾诉对对方选择自己的感激”这样的现象。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "即使是王子与贫女相爱，王子也不会有“贫女其实还差点意思，我要教她提升自我”这样的想法，而是“那些宫廷礼仪、富贵经验、如花美貌，其实都比不过你让我颤抖的纯洁心灵和勇敢的善良，你千万不要觉得配不上我，其实是我配不上你”。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你觉得自己不配，这对长期健康的关系并不是坏事，甚至是好事之一。是对方要不断地表达自己的爱，来抚慰你的纠结和恐惧，来结成一对稳定的循环。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "“ta那么好，居然会觉得配不上我，ta太傻了，我必须要告诉ta这有多么傻”——这是爱人心里的常态。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你不明白你有多可贵，只是因为这对你是理所当然的，所以你不知道珍惜。你为那些鸡毛蒜皮、其实空无一物的东西纠结担忧，只是因为你缺少它罢了。", "char_start": 440, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我如果不能让你确实地相信那些真的不要紧，其实是我不配享有你的感情。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这才是爱人们“谀词如潮”的根本原因，也是那些勾魂夺魄的“甜言蜜语”的源头。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你如果真的爱，因为无法抚慰对方的自卑而失去对方就是你最恐惧的悲剧。这不是在“搞战术”，不是在“推拉”，而是真的、真的、真的太疯狂、太遗憾。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "无论如何我都要让你相信——即使你不增加任何别的所谓优秀品质，就你现在已经天然地、本质地拥有的东西，我能得以与你相伴，我已经是万分万分的幸运了。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 721}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我没有一点点的夸张，没有一点点的勉强。", "char_start": 722, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我真的希望你知道——我有多害怕你那愚蠢的自卑让我已经抓住你的手滑脱。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我害怕，你知道吗？", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你不要再折磨我了，别再让我为你的“自卑”担忧了，好吗？", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 814}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "爱人们会说出这样的话，所以可以轻而易举地治愈世界加诸在每一个凡人身上的“自卑”，可以为长期惴惴不安的你带来你从来不敢想象的治愈。", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这种治愈的效力之强，足以翻江倒海、移星换斗、再造你的整个世界。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你是我的天神，我的天神说“是ta配不上我……”。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 938}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "如此令我仰望的你，一遍又一遍地告诉我“我有多好”，把我觉得微不足道的、不值一提的、甚至是自我遗憾、自我厌恶的东西看作真正的珍宝。告诉我我苦苦艳羡、懊恼缺少的东西，根本就不重要。", "char_start": 939, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而且你为我的犹豫和怀疑焦急、恳求、落泪。", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你不知道这对我有多么、多么、多么的重要。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1069}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你不知道你有多好，对我有多重要。", "char_start": 1070, "char_end": 1086}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你别哭了，也别害怕了。", "char_start": 1087, "char_end": 1098}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我知道了，我不会让你因为我的自卑失去我。", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1119}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "我觉得我配不配，并不重要，世人觉得我配不配，也不重要。", "char_start": 1120, "char_end": 1147}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你觉得我配，最重要。", "char_start": 1148, "char_end": 1158}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你最重要。", "char_start": 1159, "char_end": 1164}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "你的不配，是你作为爱人应有的自觉，不但不是逃避亲密关系的理由，甚至可以说是一种必备的义务，是建立亲密关系必备的一半虎符，明白吗？", "char_start": 1165, "char_end": 1229}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "而替对方消除那个“不配”感，则是爱人们必须完成的工作，是建立亲密关系的另一半虎符。", "char_start": 1230, "char_end": 1271}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而且不是完成一次，而是爱一天就要做到一天。", "char_start": 1272, "char_end": 1293}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "觉得不配，是你的困扰，但解决它却是ta的义务。", "char_start": 1294, "char_end": 1317}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "ta若无所作为，你们自然不会开始。", "char_start": 1318, "char_end": 1335}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "ta如果有所作为，但却没有让你拥有放下这个自卑的力量，你们也开始不了。", "char_start": 1336, "char_end": 1371}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因为如果ta真的爱你，你的自卑在ta的神力面前不堪一击。", "char_start": 1372, "char_end": 1400}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：对方已经具备成熟的爱人能力，而自己还未成熟，担心拖累对方，这种情况可以尝试进入亲密关系吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“不配的天神”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你觉得自己不够好、不配，这个其实不是你的课题，而是对方的课题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你觉得自己不够好、不配，这个其实不是你的课题，而是对方的课题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b35c5734-2f19-5fed-b046-6835b8b22ae6", "source_ordinal": 1461, "reading_ordinal": 2596, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "分居在前", "published_at": "2024-07-16T17:24:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661266985/answer/3563838127"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "讨论离婚期间应该首先分居，这个是标准操作。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "已经在谈论离婚了，就不要住在一个屋檐下，离婚谈判在情绪上是很激烈的，真的有可能今天脱了鞋明天就穿不上的。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 74}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而且这个“准离婚状态”不只是不应该同住，也不应该再安排同车、同食这类亲密行为，非常容易刺激出无谓的情绪反应甚至冲动行为。", "char_start": 75, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这种分居还包括不能约会他人和可以约会他人两个阶段。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "到了第二阶段，自然而然的就离了。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 178}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果婚姻走到尽头，女人心里真的只有钱了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“分居在前”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“讨论离婚期间应该首先分居，这个是标准操作。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "讨论离婚期间应该首先分居，这个是标准操作。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "12455df5-3ef1-5a12-a339-bd1fd884cd44", "source_ordinal": 1460, "reading_ordinal": 2597, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "斗兽", "published_at": "2024-07-16T21:23:39+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/281640420/answer/3564029522"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "行行行，这场子我赵日天接了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "heading", "index": 2, "text": "郑重声明，以下办法你要用的话，作为成年人和独立个体，你要自己承担一切风险。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "最简单的办法是用力抵抗，就是不停的挣脱控制这一种。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不打、不踢、不咬，不做攻击性的动作，就是不让你控制。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 106}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "抓住我的手腕可以，你稍微没抓住我就抽走了。按住我也可以，你稍微按不住我就翻身了。", "char_start": 107, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "要么对方按不住你，这不是体力不支就是怕这责任那责任，不管什么原因，ta没办到，你自然也就没事了。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要么对方有办法用绝对力量降服你而你却神奇的没有受伤。那么对方这个决心、温柔和能力自然会加上不少分——这是一种充满兽性的魅力，对刚刚努力挣扎中兽性大发的你有天然的吸引力，很容易触发肉体本能。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "其实如果你没受伤，除了对方格外注意使用技能之外，倒有一半是你自己在无意识的配合。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这种从容温柔而不可抗拒的雄性力量，如果能实现，雄狮哪怕瞎了一只眼、少了一只耳，也一样会让雌兽本能的匍匐顺从。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 387}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这不是纯靠“心狠手辣”，这里面自有某种深植在兽性本能中的自然礼仪。", "char_start": 388, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "要么对方诉诸过度的暴力，那么你是有行动反抗的，还有可验之伤，不管ta有没有成功，警察叔叔和妇联可以帮你解决剩下的问题。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "不用说，敬请注意意外运动伤害。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "别说没给你机会，抓不住就别怨了。", "char_start": 499, "char_end": 515}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何克服和不喜欢的人同床时的抵触与不适感？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“斗兽”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“行行行，这场子我赵日天接了。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "行行行，这场子我赵日天接了。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "beb74d7a-f0c1-5847-9a72-73e21127ffbd", "source_ordinal": 1459, "reading_ordinal": 2598, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "身边的深刻", "published_at": "2024-07-17T03:18:19+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/644027182/answer/3564225508"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "深刻的思想比女人的乳沟、客商的银票还诱人，稍微有点脑子的都知道不能随便露白。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "能预见未来，能定策，能安人心，能重铸乐观，这是深刻的思想最基本的属性，很显然是一种神奇的力量。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "俗话说得好，家家都有一本难念的经，这倒好，遇到了观世音坐你隔壁桌。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "乖乖我的儿，怎地放得过也么哥！", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不识货的，则会本能的意识到这些自己不敢听的话有多大的威力。其实知道自己错了，但自己赌注已下，覆水难收，恰恰是这些话难以辩驳，所以尤其要辩驳。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 207}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "又有在座已经疑心暗鬼、同床异梦的，一句话触动痛处，点醒灵机，席上就生了分别意。你三两句警语，人家三十年姻缘就要到此散了，不愿散的那个要动杀机——你说得便对，洒家也须忍不得。", "char_start": 208, "char_end": 294}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "又有一言相合，吹皱一池春水，一缕难断的情丝心底起，意马心猿难收缚，雷音寺前绽桃花。慧剑之下添芳魂，于心何忍？", "char_start": 295, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "深刻到一定程度，你要是不知道收束，只知道沉迷这份天赋带来的虚荣，你必定挨个吃尽这些教训。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你吃不上这些教训，只有一个可能——那就是你只是自我感觉深刻罢了。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实这一类的“深刻”你身边不缺，睡在你上铺的兄弟就有不少，喝多了产量更大，你只是不知道ta的知乎号罢了。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 482}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么知乎上能有那么多深刻的思想，现实里遇到的人都那么肤浅和世俗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“身边的深刻”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“深刻的思想比女人的乳沟、客商的银票还诱人，稍微有点脑子的都知道不能随便露白。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "深刻的思想比女人的乳沟、客商的银票还诱人，稍微有点脑子的都知道不能随便露白。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a4b9a6f3-6e4f-5b21-a5db-8c234bef081d", "source_ordinal": 1458, "reading_ordinal": 2599, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "四门功课", "published_at": "2024-07-17T04:19:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/661398325/answer/3564233133"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫做“专心”？什么叫做“一项功夫”？什么叫做“练好”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "专心，意思是只有在练这项功夫的时候认真投入注意力资源、智力资源，别的功夫都先敷衍着。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一项功夫，姑且以交付物为单位吧，能完成一项不可再分的交付物的劳动，我们叫它一项功夫吧。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如蒸一碗鸡蛋羹，这叫一项功夫。但如果你炒个河粉，再煎个荷包蛋卧河粉上，这个算两项功夫。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 161}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "什么叫练好？比如鸡蛋羹有个优秀标准，达到这个优秀标准，我们算练好。", "char_start": 162, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "然后我们来看你一天的生活实践：", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "早上起来洗漱，洗漱算不算一件功夫？它向你交付了一个干净的身体，不是吗？它有质量标准、有成本效率问题，不是吗？", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 266}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后你做早饭，一项功夫吧？", "char_start": 267, "char_end": 280}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "然后你边看新闻边吃饭，看新闻是不是一项功夫？", "char_start": 281, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "然后你收拾东西去上学，收拾东西是不是一项功夫？", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "然后你上午学数学，下午学钢琴，这是不是两项功夫？", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 352}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "然后一项一项又一项，到了半夜，你睡了。睡觉是不是一项功夫？", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你发现问题没有？", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "按照这个定义，你根本就没有“只做一份功夫”的可能性，区别只在于你用不用心。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你能不能做到这一整天啥事都像梦游，唯独上数学课时用心？", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 457}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "可以当然是可以，但是你该这样做吗？", "char_start": 458, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那不如干脆安排成整天都是数学课不好吗？先连学一年，把语文学到本科，再连学一年，把数学学到本科，再花一整年，把体育练到本科……这样安排吗？", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "能这么安排吗？", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 552}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你很快就会发现这并没有什么神奇的效率。", "char_start": 553, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "所以，毫无疑问的，在绝对严谨的意义上，你必然要“几项功夫同时修炼”，没有任何纠结模糊的余地。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "人是一个整体，你的微积分没解出来，也可能不是因为你没学好导数运算，还可能是因为你没睡好。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 664}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "人的任何一种劳动都是很多项功夫的组合，哪怕只是交付最小可用的交付物，都一样是好几项功夫的组合，因此根本就不存在“专心练好一门功夫再练其他”这个做法。这个做法，无非是把衣食住行这些全都刨掉，其他工序全都外包，仅仅留下一步画龙点睛留给你来“练”的结果。", "char_start": 665, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这其实是一种“作弊”。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 801}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你真正的问题不是在同时练几项上，而是在“练好”上。", "char_start": 802, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "要交付一个东西，就要同时练几门，几门都要练好，交付的这东西要到优秀水平——做到能卖的水平。到了这一步，再考虑下一组功夫。", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你别练了无数道功夫，也没练出任何能上架销售的能力，这想想也是巨亏吧？", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 923}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：先专心练好一项功夫和几项功夫同时修炼，哪个更好？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“四门功课”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫做“专心”？什么叫做“一项功夫”？什么叫做“练好”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫做“专心”？什么叫做“一项功夫”？什么叫做“练好”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e296bdf4-5ca3-5088-93b9-1afa64bc9d30", "source_ordinal": 1457, "reading_ordinal": 2600, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "有重量的自由", "published_at": "2024-07-17T16:38:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/585515462/answer/3564878557"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "ta可以预支零花钱啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "让ta花自己的份额不就行了？", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "小朋友一旦学会加减乘除，就要同时设立ta的账户。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 51}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一旦学会复利计算，就可以获得贷款额度，他的钱还可以累进计息。", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦学会了做家务，就可以打工挣钱。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一切都照规矩来就行了。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "父母没有必要去纠结“这笔钱该不该给”“那笔钱该不该给”。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 141}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "永远是到了时间ta的零花钱就会自动进账，打完工就可以领工单，到月底结算。", "char_start": 142, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "钱是ta的，在约定范围内ta可以有很大的支配权。要买娃娃？买得起你就买。要请客？舍得你就请。你自己觉得值得就行，你只是要自己慢慢的煎熬那个积少成多的过程，要一手一脚去挣，要冒风险去搏。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "注意，生活费你是不能拿去请客的，只能拿来决定点菜买衣服。零花钱（包括劳动所得）才是你可以预支的部分。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "价值教育不要搞在“这个值不值，那个值不值”上，要搞在“每一分钱都必须付出代价”上——不是要熬耐心，就是出劳动，要么就要冒风险，没有一分钱是白来的。（生活费是白来的，是来自父母的抚养义务，于是生活费是严监管。）", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "做到了，你这份自由就是自己赚来的。你有资格决定怎么“挥霍”。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "如果你是花自己账户里的钱，那么我何止不阻止你用120，我甚至会建议你慎重考虑索性请客。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "劳动所得当然要用在享受爱自己亲朋好友的过程中。", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "三个人每人请一次整客，比起三次AA，实际上会额外买到更深刻的感情。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "三次AA动用的资金总量其实是一样的，少冒了“有人打破惯例”的风险，但却损失了额外的友谊。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 605}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这个额外的友谊的珍贵程度，远远超过有人白占便宜的风险有余。", "char_start": 606, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "冒着亏损240的风险，买持续几年甚至一生的友情机会——虽然仅仅是机会——这是大赚。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 677}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所以，我亲爱的客户，这种一本万利、以小博大的机会，要不要博？", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "博不起，你可以找本行贷款哦。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "出于对你这个项目的看好，这个贷款利息极低、无需用你的奥特曼抵押哦。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "Be a man!", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "本行看好你。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 774}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0379"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子五年级11岁，周末和同学约好在万达吃火锅，每人准备120元，合适吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“有重量的自由”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“ta可以预支零花钱啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "ta可以预支零花钱啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
